<title>UK: Fannie Mae sets 250 mln stg March 2001 bond.</title>
<headline>Fannie Mae sets 250 mln stg March 2001 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FANNIE MAE</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN STG   COUPON     6.43	MATURITY    22.MAR.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE  S-24.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    PAR	 S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	JAPAN RETAIL TARGETEDBOND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
